<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="MAL" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">MALAKHI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Malachi</para>
  <para style="toc2">MALAKHI</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mal</para>
  <para style="mt1">MALAKHI</para>
  <para style="mt2">Malachi</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">Malakhi ccauh hynh Jerusalem Beikinn sakthui koute, BC 400 loukaw kya a poupaw thua zah, profeh Malakhi nynh abyapi lan a hopaw tuh ranpibawi hae te zapi hae nynh Pachia kalan bya a kinku hae paw thawsah thui lanpaw kong nynh thua. Pachia ccungccaw hae tuh mih hiinnaw kya te Pachia beiknaw kya sawphahkuh hae zah mih ozia aroh cipaw phe aria. Ranpibawi hae te zapi hae nynh Pachia kalan rae lanpaw silawnaw kha rae leite, a ccangpyanaw thyhte hiin leite Pachia kha a hynpya hae. Thuasalama Bawipaw tuh a ccungccaw hae kha byapia khylan te thyaasah khylan yn thua cih, laanpi paccyn khylan te a byakinnaw phy khylan a locceihtu kha amaw malang yn saw ty cih.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abyalupi hae</para>
  <para style="io1">Israel seinaw 1.1—2.16</para>
  <para style="io1">Pachia byapianaw te a thawccinaw 2.17—4.6</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hodaebya. Malakhi kyate Israel kalan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh yn thua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel A Sungsah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh, Nanning kha kae sungsah oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.2-3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:13">Rom 9.13</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.2-5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:5-17">Isa 34.5-17</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 63:1-6">63.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:7-22">Jer 49.7-22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:12-14">Eze 25.12-14</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 35:1-15">35.1-15</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:11-12">Amo 1.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:1-14">Oba 1-14</ref></char></note> Thuasalama nanning nynh, “Pawtemou kaening kha nae sungsah?” na ci oh. Esau tuh Jakob upaw thua khyh tou? cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. Tuhzemah Jakob kha ka sungsah, <verse number="3" style="v" />thuasalama Esau tuh ka hua; a muaram kha alakawpaw lang ka rae cih zah a rho laephi kha suizaw hae hanlan ramkaw lang ka rae cih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Edom nynh, “Aening tuh phiariphiarae nung ah thua oh zemah, arohpaw khua hae kha bua ah sakthui cih oh,” cite a ho hae ze, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Minmin nynh a sak kho hae zemah kae nynh ka roh cih, minmin tuh ahoy leipaw ram, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh zungzae a thinrianuapaw minphuin, cite ko athua cih hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh nae mit te na muih cih oh zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh Israel ram atolang cia alesae!” cite na ho cih oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ranpibawi Ozia Ronaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ccapaw nynh a paaw kha sawtua zah, ryalahtu hae nynh mih bawipaw kha saw a tua hae. Kae tuh paaw ka thua lanze, ka tungvaw sawtuanaw tuh teimou a um? Kae tuh bawi ka thua lanze, ka tungvaw sawtuanaw tuh teimou a um? cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a min pawlangria lei hae paw nanning, ranpibawi hae kha ae hopya oh. Nanning nynh, “Pawcihtemou na min tuh pawlang kae ria khyh?” na ci oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka silawhang vawlan khe anungsikuhpaw looh kha nae thuakhae oh. Te nanning nynh, “Tuh-e looh tuh pawcihtemou kae nungsisaku?” na ci oh. Tuhcite na honaw oh liate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ccaboi tuh pawlang na ria vae khyh oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />A mitzupaw sarangpaw khate si na law vae oh ze, tuh-e tuh sei khyh tou? Te a ccukhoupaw te thuasah, accihpaw te thuasah si na law vae oh ze, tuh-e tuh sei khyh tou? Tuhcite nae uktu bawi kha na pya oh ze, nae tungvaw a lungrythua cih tou? Maehoynaw ae pya cih oh tou? cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:21">Deu 15.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Te Pachia nynh aening kha thaw oun cci nawlan, amaw kya-e maehoynaw kha ngiaku tua oh. Nanning tuh na sei oh. Aning nynh nanning kha lu kheit sanmah maehoynaw ae pya cih oh zawtou? cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="10" style="v" />Nanning nynh ka silawhang kya alakaw lan mae na aw khyh nawlan oh, nanning lukhakheit nynh beikinn thuakaw hae kha khaw vae sah! Nae tungvaw ka lungrythua khyh, nae kuih kya-e pyapaw ahlu kha ka ccou lan khyh, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="11" style="v" />Khuanin a thuanaw kyate a ccawnaw kyacia ka min tuh minphuin hae laku kya alesae, khyzawvawkaw kya mynkhuhpaw te athyaapaw pyapaw uccaw tuh ka min te a pya hae; ka min tuh minphuin hae kya myarya alesae, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="12" style="v" />Thuasalama nanning nynh tuh, Bawipaw ccaboi tuh anungsikuh, ccaboi vawlan e looh tuh pawlangria leite um kho athua, na ci oh zah ccaboi kha na nungsisaku oh. <verse number="13" style="v" />“E ryalaw tuh thawbang lan kou um,” na ci oh zah, kae kha nae sarya oh, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. Puathote na lawku oh paw kha thuasah, a ccukhoupaw, accihpaw kha thuasah pyapaw uccaw lante nae ccyng oh! Nae kuih kya-e tuh-e tuh kae ccoupah cih oh tou? cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="14" style="v" />A tuuphu kya tuutepaw mang a um pite, pya lan byakinkuh zah douccah leipaw sahiin te Bawipaw kalan si a lawpaw, ahynpaw ccungccaw tungvaw kya thyalawnaw um sah; kae tuh alesaepaw Siapharan ka thua zah, ka min tuh minphuin hae nynh saw a tua hae, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pou ranpibawi hae, e kawpyanaw hynh nanning hanlan nynh thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Nanning nynh ka bya na ngae khyh oh zah, ka min kha phu-enaw pya lan nae thinlung kya na ccykeku khyh zetuh, nae tungvaw thyalawnaw ka thuasah cih zah hythuanaw na ccou oh paw kha thya ka law cih, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ho; nae thinlung kya na ccykeku khyh oh keiccuze, hythuanaw na ccou oh paw kha thya ka law ccaccing vae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Nae ciihan hae kha de ka tah cih hae zah, sahiinpaw ia athuapaw nae kya-e pyapaw uccaw khate nae mae kha kae noi cih oh, te ka malang te ccaring kae dee cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tetuh Levi phin ryte ka raepaw byakinnaw tuh atyn nawlan, e kawpyanaw hynh nanning kalan kae pya vae oh cipaw nyh oh, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:11-13">Nam 3.11-13</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Levi phin ryte ka raepaw ka byakinnaw tuh hiinnaw byakin te daenaw byakin thua zah, tuh-e tuh aning kha ka pya; e hynh sawtuanaw hanlan nynh thua, aning nynh kae kha saw yn tua zah ka min raw kha a rih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:12">Nam 25.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahmepaw ccangpyanaw kha ho zah, a munglae kya dingleinaw kha muih lan um khyh. Daenaw te dingnaw thyhte kae te kae cceihkheih zah, ccungccaw patae kha hoyleinaw kyate a kikhae hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ranpibawi munglae nynh nynaw kha phang a rin cih zah, ccungccaw hae nynh a munglae kyakhe ccangpyanaw kha a ccung cih hae, pawccecize aning tuh vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e locceihtu nynh thua. <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama nanning tuh tuh-e laanpi kyate na maeleihkuh vae oh; na ccangpyanaw oh khate ccungccaw patae kha na khuliasakuh vae oh; Levi phin ryte ka raepaw byakinnaw kha na ro vae oh, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci, <verse number="9" style="v" />tuhcite nanning nynh ka laanpi kha zui leite na ccangpyanaw oh kya mirymihua na tua oh keiccuze ccungccaw balyn nynh pawlangria lei hae paw te thethyasah hae paw lang kae rae oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Judah nynh Byakinnaw A Thusah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aening balyn tuh paaw lu kheit kyalya ah hoi khyh oh tou? Ccangkheit kyalyapaw Pachia nynh aening hynh oun rae khyh tou? Ah minpaaw hae kya-e byakinnaw kha thusahte, pawccemou lu kheit te lu kheit laku lungzinaw ah hoi khyh oh? <verse number="11" style="v" />Judah tuh a lungzi vae khyh, Israel te Jerusalem kya anungsikuhpaw kha rae athua vae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a rypaw beikinnthyaa kha Judah nynh thusah zah, ramccang pachia ccanung kha zu lang a umkhae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuhcite a cyihpaw miakaw—ccangpahtu thuasah, a ccangkuhtu thuasah, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan pyapaw uccaw a ccyngpaw thuasah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Jakob umnaw hmin kyate dee vae sah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />E hynh mah na cyi ung oh: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> silawhang tuh mitphi te thuasah, rawkhuinaw te hawkhaekunaw khate thuasah na bong oh, pawccecize aning nynh pyapaw uccaw kha a peki khyh, nae kuih kya-e silawnaw kha mah a lungrythua khyh zah ccou khyh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Nanning nynh, “Pawkeiccumou athua?” cite na khia oh. Pawkeiccumou ci ze, na ccangvae lya-e na zu tuh byakinnaw te mang na umkheih oh pite, aning tungvaw na lungzi khyh, te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh nang te tuh-e na zu laku kya ccaekia nynh thua. <verse number="15" style="v" />Ccangkheit kyalyapaw Pachia nynh amaw kha rae khyh tou? A pynsaw te a muisaw tuh namaw kya-e nynh thua. Ccangkheit kyalyapaw Pachia nynh pawmou a ry? Pachia rawrihpaw ciihan kha nynh a ry. Tukeiccuze naemaw te naemaw tuakuh oh lah, humhung nynh mah a ccangvae lya-e a zu tungvaw lungzi leite um nan sah. <verse number="16" style="v" />Zu myanaw kha thuasah, zu tungvaw rysawthyate cyisahnaw kha thuasah ka hua, cite Israel Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ho. Tukeiccuze nae thinlung kya raeringkuh oh lah, lungzi leite um nan oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nae bya te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha phe na nynsah vae oh. Nanning nynh, “Pawcitemou kae nynsah?” na ci oh. “Hoyleinaw a raetu hae balyn tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya ahoy hae, te mih tungvaw kya a lungrythua,” cite na ho oh zah, “Byading Pachia tuh teimou a um?” cite khiate na nynsah oh.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Oun Thua Cih paw Zeccuetu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Dotua, ka ccianaw laanpi kha paccyn khylan ka zeccuetu kha ka saw cih, na ccung oh paw Bawipaw tuh amaw beikinn langkhe palou yn thua cih. Nanning nynh nae lungrythuapaw byakinnaw zeccuetu tuh yn thua ccaccing cih, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:10">Mat 11.10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:2">Mar 1.2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:76">Luk 1.76</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 7:27">7.27</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Aning yn thua nin tuh hummou a teing kho cih? Aning he yn langkuh te hummou a thadyn kho cih?</para>
  <para style="p">Tuh-e zeccuetu tuh sivaw thyaasahtu kya-e somaee te boeisuhtu kya-e saepia hawte nynh thua;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:11">Joe 2.11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:17">Bya 6.17</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />aning tuh sivaw te ngun thyaasahtu hawte a haung cih zah, Levi ciihan hae nynh pyapaw uccaw hae kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan dingnaw te a pya mawlaezung hae, minmin kha sui te ngun thyaasah hawte a thyaasah cih hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tetuh Judah te Jerusalem kya-e pyapaw uccaw kha alia vae paw nin te kum lya hawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a lungrythua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kae tuh nae kalan byapia khylan kae naekuh cih; naawthya hae paw, milae zu milae vawpaw te a sei hae paw, ahme lei lante thyalawkuh hae paw, ryalahtu hae kha mih ryalaw mee pya leite a tuaa a sah hae paw, nomae hae te ngawraw hae, ramccang ccungccaw hae kha amia ccungnahkuh hae paw te ka rawrih lei hae paw kha rawsete ccaekia lang arangte ka tang cih, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="6" style="v" />Kae tuh arulaekuh leipaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka thua. Tukeiccuze, pou Jakob ccaaw hae, nanning tuh phe na roh khyh oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Nae minpaaw hae she lyate ka phungbya kyate na maeleihkuh oh zah na zui khyh oh. Ka kalan oun ki oh lah, kae mah nae kalan kae ki cih, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. Thuasalama nanning nynh, “Pawcitemou kae ki cih?” na ci oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia Uccaw Luade Nan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ccungccaw nynh Pachia uccaw kha a luade cih tou? Thuasalama nanning nynh ka uccaw kha nae luade oh! Nanning nynh, “Pawcitemou nang kha kae luade?” na ci oh. Pumhaw pumkheit thuasah, pyapaw uccaw hae thuasah nae luade oh! <verse number="9" style="v" />Nanning nynh ka uccaw kha nae luade oh keiccuze minphuin pynpi te nanning kha thyalaw na thua oh! <verse number="10" style="v" />Pumhaw pumkheit kha abalynte sisuainn lungkhu lang oun thuakhae oh, tuhteze nynh ka inn kya looh a um cih, te nanning hanlan vaaw thuakaw kha hungte paepae leikuhpaw hythuanaw kha kae bunua oh tah, kae bunua khyh oh tah, yn syntawtua oh, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:30">Lev 27.30</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 18:21-24">Nam 18.21-24</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:6">Deu 12.6</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 14:22-29">14.22-29</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 13:12">Neh 13.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Tungkhipaw kha ka thuihei cih zah nae laephi kyate apoupaw ccathae kha roh lan khyh; nae khokhu kya umpaw misu ku tuh athae thae leite um lan khyh, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="12" style="v" />Nae ram tuh lungrythua lan umpaw ram athua cih keiccuze minphuin hae balyn nynh nanning kha lungtuapaw ae ci cih oh, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nanning nynh kae kha rawsete byarepaw kha na ho oh, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. Tuhzemah nanning nynh, “Nang kha rawsete pawtemou bya kae ho?” na ci oh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Nanning nynh, “Pachia rya kha law tuh alakawpaw nynh thua. Rya oun nawpaw kha law liate thuasah, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe a rah a khui hae paw hawte umsaku liate thuasah aening nynh thanenaw pawmou ah mue cih oh? <verse number="15" style="v" />Aening nynh a lysakuh hae paw kha lungtua hae paw ah ci vae oh; hoyleinaw a rae hae paw tuh mih laan mih sui a ua apiaze Pachia kha a syntawtua hae zemah a lue hae,” cite na ho oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Lungzi hae paw Ryalaw Mee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rawrih hae paw nynh lu kheit te lu kheit a hoku hae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ngae zah phe a thae, te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rawrih hae paw te amaw min kha saw a tua hae paw tuh a malang e ccazing kyakhe mih min kha a zei hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka paccynpaw nin khe minmin tuh kamaw nynh ka hoipaw ka kya-e athua cih hae, te paaw nynh a hanlan ryalawpahpaw a ccapaw kha thaw a cci hawte minmin kha thaw ka ccih cih hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Miding te mihoy leipaw alaenaw kha thuasah, Pachia rya a lahpaw te a lah leipaw alaenaw kha thuasah na muih cih oh.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Nin Alesaepaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Somaee hawte asopaw nin tuh yn thua cih, a lysakuh hae paw te hoyleinaw a raetu hae balyn tuh ccatanphue athua cih hae; mih tharui te mih karan hae kha a laehypaw um lei lan ciate tuh-e nin nynh khaleih a u cih hae, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="2" style="v" />Thuasalama ka min saw na tua oh paw nanning hanlan tuh a sake kya dannaw a umpaw dingnaw khuanin yn thua cih. Sahiinkhia kyate vaetuataw hae thohkute a pou hae hawte lungtuate na pou cih oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka paccynpaw nin kyakhe ccungccaw hoylei hae paw kha na syde cih oh zah, nae ccuphe kaw khe buhhaw lang a tang cih hae, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka ryalahtu Moses a ccangpyanaw kha liathui oh, Israel hae balyn hanlan Horeb mua kya amaw ka pyapaw phungbya hae te phungzae hae kha liathui oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Alesaepaw nin te ri lan umpaw nin, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nin yn thua mawkhe, profeh Elijah kha nae kalan kae saw cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:14">Mat 11.14</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 17:10-13">17.10-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:11-13">Mar 9.11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:17">Luk 1.17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:21">Joh 1.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Ram kha thyalawte detah khylan kae thua khyh nawlan, aning nynh nungpaaw hae kha ccaaw hae te thuasah, ccaaw hae kha nungpaaw hae te thuasah a ccawsakuh thui cih hae.</para>
</usx>